<div class="w-full rounded-2xl bg-slate-100 p-10 shadow-lg">
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-blue-700">
    Rails mit Tailwindcss
  </h1>

  <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-fuchsia-500">
    Rails mit Tailwindcss
  </h1>

  <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-red-600">
    Rails 7 mit dem gem tailwindcss ist erfolgreich verbunden.
  </p>

  <button class="mt-6 rounded-lg bg-red-600 px-5 py-2 font-semibold text-white hover:bg-red-700">
    Login
  </button>

  <button class="mt-6 rounded-lg bg-cyan-600 px-5 py-2 font-semibold text-white hover:bg-red-700"
    data-controller="hello"
    data-action="click->hello#greet"
  >
    Hello Stimulus
  </button>

  <div id="show-fix-content" class="mt-2 text-fuchsia-600">
    FIX: Stimulus, wenn es nicht funktioniert
    <p> assets/builds (ausser .keep) </p>
    <p> run rails stimulus:install</p>
  </div>

  <%= button_to "go to product",
                root_path,
                method: :get,
                type: "button",
                class: "mt-6 rounded-lg bg-red-600 px-5 py-2 font-semibold text-white hover:bg-red-700" %>



  <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-blue-500">
    Rails mit Tailwindcss
  </h1>

  <div class="mt-6 flex w-full items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-green-600 p-3 text-white">
    <div class="rounded bg-red-600 px-3 py-1">01</div>
    <div class="rounded bg-amber-400 px-3 py-1 text-slate-900">02</div>
    <div class="rounded bg-amber-200 px-3 py-1 text-slate-900">03</div>
  </div>
</div>